	(text "CN1: FFC to the digital board CN1 (module link), C5123103. Mount on the BOTTOM side at the\nsame X/Y as the digital CN1, opening toward the left board edge. Seen from the top it is\nmirrored, so the pin order is reversed: pin N here = digital CN1 pin 25-N.\nPin 4 = MOD_PRESENT# (tied to GND: module present). Pin 5 = MOD_RESET#, pin 2 = MOD_SPARE (unused)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 149.86 0)
		(effects
